# 统一换行策略：文本按内容存储，检出时按平台/文件类型还原。
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本必须是 CRLF，否则 PowerShell 5.1 / cmd 可能解析异常
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 跨平台脚本保持 LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做换行转换，也不试图 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.db binary
*.pptx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary